+; Apollo RP's jails on h9_tsrp_hive: the four cells of the Alexandria district's jail (the Jail Mod
+; plugin, ARP_JailMod). Each jail, as in example_config\jailmod.ini:
+;   [name]   as the jail menu (jailmodmenu) and the HUD show it
+;   origin   where a jailed player is put: inside the cell, on its floor
+;   command  "jail <command>" in the console puts the player you look at there
+; and the map's own controls of the cell (H9):
+;   cage     the cell's cage, the door that shuts it
+;   toggle   what opens and shuts it (the map's manager: the cage, its glass and the siren); jailing
+;            someone here shuts the cage on him, freeing him opens it
+;   panel    the cell's wall panel, a door of the locked property "h9_jail": only police open and
+;            shut the cell with it (arp_police_access)
+
+[Cell 1]
+origin "-1824 -352 -3490"
+command "1"
+cage "al_cell1"
+toggle "al_cell1mm"
+panel "al_jail1act"
+
+[Cell 2]
+origin "-1824 -608 -3490"
+command "2"
+cage "al_cell2"
+toggle "al_cell2mm"
+panel "al_jail2act"
+
+[Cell 3]
+origin "-1568 -608 -3490"
+command "3"
+cage "al_cell3"
+toggle "al_cell3mm"
+panel "al_jail3act"
+
+[Cell 4]
+origin "-1568 -352 -3490"
+command "4"
+cage "al_cell4"
+toggle "al_cell4mm"
+panel "al_jail4act"
